{{- /* Legacy: mentee-application-received. Legacy always had tasks; without any, the task sentences are left out. */ -}}
{{template "header" .}}{{template "greeting" (printf "Hi %s!" .RecipientName)}}<p>Thank you for your interest in becoming a mentee on LFX Mentorship!</p>
{{if .Tasks}}<p>Your initial application for the <strong>{{.ProgramName}}</strong> mentorship program has been received. To continue the application process, you need to complete a set of prerequisite tasks and submit them for review. Upon successful completion of the tasks, your mentorship application will be reviewed, and you will be notified about the admission decision.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>Prerequisite tasks:</strong></p>
{{template "tasks" .Tasks}}<p style="margin:16px 0;">Please login to LFX Mentorship at your earliest convenience to complete the tasks or select the link below.</p>
{{else}}<p>Your initial application for the <strong>{{.ProgramName}}</strong> mentorship program has been received. Your mentorship application will be reviewed, and you will be notified about the admission decision.</p>
{{end}}<p>Best of luck with your application!</p>
{{template "button" .ManageURL}}{{if .Tasks}}View Prerequisite Tasks{{else}}View Application{{end}}{{template "button_end"}}{{template "footer" .}}
